{"text": "In front of the castle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Little trees stood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Around a small mirror. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The mirror looked like a lake. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And wax swans. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Were swimming on it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the open door of the castle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Stood a pretty little lady. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was a dancer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And she was cut out of paper too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She wore a dress. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of thin cloth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a narrow blue ribbon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the middle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was a shiny spangle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As big as her face. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was holding out both arms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because she was dancing. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was kicking one leg up. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So high. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That he could not see it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She has only one leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just like me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Thought the soldier. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But she lives in a castle. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And I only have a box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He lay down. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind a snuffbox on the table. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To watch her.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "n", " ", "f", "r", "o", "n", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "a", "s", "t", "l", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "L", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "s", " ", "s", "t", "o", "o", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "m", "i", "r", "r", "o", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "